{"address": "wh-ZKZJZE0AY1/en.elegant", "passage_uid": "wh-ZKZJZE0AY1", "name": "en.elegant", "lang": "en", "role": "elegant", "text": "which the King of the nations, fruit of a noble womb, poured out as the price of the world.", "generated": false, "source": "house-elegant-2026-09-15", "attested": "N", "reading_of_record": false}
{"address": "wh-AXB3RQ4Y1N/en.singable", "passage_uid": "wh-AXB3RQ4Y1N", "name": "en.singable", "lang": "en", "role": "singable", "text": "Sing, my tongue, the Saviour's glory,\nOf His Flesh the mystery sing;\nOf the Blood, all price exceeding,\nShed by our immortal King,\nDestined, for the world's redemption,\nFrom a noble womb to spring.", "generated": false, "source": "caswall-1849-britt-1922", "attested": "Y", "reading_of_record": false}
{"address": "wh-AXB3RQ4Y1N/en.literal", "passage_uid": "wh-AXB3RQ4Y1N", "name": "en.literal", "lang": "en", "role": "literal-prose", "text": "Sing, O my tongue, the mystery of the glorious Body and of the precious Blood, which the King of the Gentiles, the fruit of a noble womb, shed for the redemption of the world.", "generated": false, "source": "britt-1922-prose", "attested": "Y", "reading_of_record": false}
{"address": "wh-G1VG74Z7Q5/la.1", "passage_uid": "wh-G1VG74Z7Q5", "name": "la.1", "lang": "la", "role": "original", "register": "medieval-latin", "text": "Nobis datus, nobis natus\nEx intacta Virgine,\nEt in mundo conversatus,\nSparso verbi semine,\nSui moras incolatus\nMiro clausit ordine.", "generated": false, "source": "roman-missal-received", "attested": "Y", "reading_of_record": true, "cut_from": "wh-WGV9RPVKMF/la.1"}
{"address": "wh-G1VG74Z7Q5/en.wooden", "passage_uid": "wh-G1VG74Z7Q5", "name": "en.wooden", "lang": "en", "role": "wooden", "text": null, "generated": true, "generated_from": "la.1 token gloss, Latin order", "source": "house-draft-2026-09-14", "attested": "N", "reading_of_record": false}
{"address": "wh-G1VG74Z7Q5/en.plain", "passage_uid": "wh-G1VG74Z7Q5", "name": "en.plain", "lang": "en", "role": "plain", "text": null, "generated": true, "generated_from": "la.1 tokens walked in prose_order", "prose_order": [2, 1, 4, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8, 11, 9, 10, 12, 14, 13, 19, 16, "of", 15, 17, "in", 18, 20], "absorbed": [], "plain_override": null, "source": "house-retrofit-2026-09-15", "attested": "N", "reading_of_record": false}
{"address": "wh-G1VG74Z7Q5/en.elegant", "passage_uid": "wh-G1VG74Z7Q5", "name": "en.elegant", "lang": "en", "role": "elegant", "text": "Given to us, born to us of a Virgin untouched, and having dwelt in the world, having scattered the seed of the word, he closed the days of his sojourn in wondrous order.", "generated": false, "source": "house-elegant-2026-09-15", "attested": "N", "reading_of_record": false}
{"address": "wh-WGV9RPVKMF/en.singable", "passage_uid": "wh-WGV9RPVKMF", "name": "en.singable", "lang": "en", "role": "singable", "text": "Of a pure and spotless Virgin\nBorn for us on earth below,\nHe, as Man, with man conversing,\nStayed, the seeds of truth to sow;\nThen He closed in solemn order\nWondrously His life of woe.", "generated": false, "source": "caswall-1849-britt-1922", "attested": "Y", "reading_of_record": false}
{"address": "wh-WGV9RPVKMF/en.literal", "passage_uid": "wh-WGV9RPVKMF", "name": "en.literal", "lang": "en", "role": "literal-prose", "text": "Given to us, and born for us of a stainless Virgin, He dwelt on earth sowing the seed of the word, and closed in a wondrous manner the days of His earthly sojourning.", "generated": false, "source": "britt-1922-prose", "attested": "Y", "reading_of_record": false}
{"address": "wh-6BK80FRWKN/la.1", "passage_uid": "wh-6BK80FRWKN", "name": "la.1", "lang": "la", "role": "original", "register": "medieval-latin", "text": "In supremae nocte cenae\nRecumbens cum fratribus,\nObservata lege plene\nCibis in legalibus,\nCibum turbae duodenae\nSe dat suis manibus.", "generated": false, "source": "roman-missal-received", "attested": "Y", "reading_of_record": true, "cut_from": "wh-75ZSDBAEHF/la.1"}
{"address": "wh-6BK80FRWKN/en.wooden", "passage_uid": "wh-6BK80FRWKN", "name": "en.wooden", "lang": "en", "role": "wooden", "text": null, "generated": true, "generated_from": "la.1 token gloss, Latin order", "source": "house-draft-2026-09-14", "attested": "N", "reading_of_record": false}
